  {
    "surah_id": 70,
    "ayah_number": 14,
    "global_ayah_id": 5458,
    "tafseer": "(a) The scenes of Doomsday cannot either be revealed in reality or truly described in the present world. However, in the Quran, these have been allegorically conveyed by allusions and examples, so that man should have a brief idea of their significance. When Doomsday arrives, it will be so terrible that man will forget this relations and the interests to which he gives the utmost importance today and for which he ignores the Truth."
